ty  after all he and the series main  character are incredibly similar  visually  and they're in the same profession so a  crossover felt like a given  the previous season didn't do much to  satiate this subset of fans  but thankfully for them season 2 is  going all in  now at long last jango fett's clone's  son is once again making his way to the  forefront of the star wars universe  and by the looks of things he's in no  mood to make friends  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the mandalorian season 2 are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and to  the bell so you don't miss  a single one  [Music]

